y me?\", \"Would you mind showing just the circle ones?\", \"On another note, could you tell me whether Teodora Yamamoto owes me anything?\", \"Also, would you mind telling me who is coming to the test?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-061\", \"v\": [[\"hmm so who is Vesna Grieve again, remind me?\", \"oh different thing, could you pull up my password login entry for me?\", \"right, and what about Payroll backup then?\", \"ok and uh what about Payroll login?\"], [\"Who is Vesna Grieve?\", \"Can you show me the password login entry?\", \"What about Payroll backup?\", \"And what about Payroll login?\"], [\"Could you tell me who Vesna Grieve is, please?\", \"On a separate matter, would you mind showing me the password login entry?\", \"Thank you. What about Payroll backup?\", \"And what about Payroll login, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-062\", \"v\": [[\"What's in my Car folder?\", \"What's the email for Sedgefield Physio?\", \"Can you make a note called Gift ideas for the twins?\", \"Can you pull up Wilhelmina Thackeray?\", \"What's Juno Castell's mobile number?\", \"Do I have any photos of samples?\"], [\"Car folder contents?\", \"Sedgefield Physio email?\", \"new note: Gift ideas for the twins\", \"Wilhelmina Thackeray\", \"Juno Castell mobile?\", \"photos of samples?\"], [\"whats in my car folder\", \"whats sedgefield physio's email\", \"make a note called gift ideas for the twins pls\", \"pull up wilhelmina thackeray\", \"juno castell's mobile number?\", \"got any pics of samples\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-063\", \"v\": [[\"what am I behind on?\", \"docs mentioning Payslip?\", \"and Fishing?\", \"photos too?\", \"rain?\"], [\"What am I behind on at the moment?\", \"Which documents mention Payslip?\", \"What about Fishing?\", \"Are there any photos of it as well?\", \"What about rain?\"], [\"what am i behind on\", \"diff thing which docs mention payslip\", \"what about fishing\", \"any pics of it too\", \"what about rain\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-064\", \"v\": [[\"umm so what haven't I actually got done yet, like what's still left?\", \"oh ok, could you just show me the ones for this week?\"], [\"What haven't I done yet?\", \"Can you show only the ones this week?\"], [\"what's not done yet?\", \"just this week\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-065\", \"v\": [[\"Can you log a visit with Rhiannon?\", \"It was Rhiannon Kilbride.\", \"Which events are they coming to?\", \"Who's in the lunch fund group?\", \"How much does Florian owe me in that group?\", \"How many is that?\"], [\"log a visit w rhiannon\", \"the kilbride one\", \"what events are they coming to\", \"diff thing whos in the lunch fund group\", \"how much does florian owe me in there\", \"how many is that\"], [\"hey so could you log a visit with Rhiannon for me please?\", \"oh sorry, I meant the Kilbride one, Rhiannon Kilbride.\", \"and umm what events is she, uh, they coming to, do you know?\", \"right, totally different thing, who's actually in the lunch fund group?\", \"and how much does Florian owe me in that group, roughly?\", \"hmm and how many is that then?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-066\", \"v\": [[\"umm so I was curious, what sort of places show up in my photos, like where have I been?\"], [\"what places r in my pics\"], [\"Which places are in my photos?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-067\", \"v\": [[\"hey so umm what day is the Saltmarsh thing on again?\", \"oh and is it in my to-dos as well, by any chance?\", \"hmm what about in my calendar events then?\"], [\"Could you tell me what day the Saltmarsh is on, please?\", \"Would you mind checking whether it's in my to-dos as well?\", \"And what about in my calendar events?\"], [\"What day is the Saltmarsh on?\", \"Is it in my to-dos too?\", \"What about my calendar events?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-068\", \"v\": [[\"show me the water login\", \"diff thing whats owed between me n teodora yamamoto\", \"also what does pottery gang's spending come to\"], [\"Could you show me the Water login entry, please?\", \"On another matter, would you mind telling me what debts there